# ============================================================================
#  .gitignore dlya Z80_EMU
#
#  Ch T O  N E  K H R A N I M  I  P O Ch E M U.
#
#  * build/ -- rezultat sborki CODESYS. On polnostyu vosproizvoditsya
#    komandoy generator\run_build_log.cmd iz src/. Vnyom lezhit 1.5 MB
#    sluzhebnyh fajlov (.bootinfo, .compileinfo), kotorye menyayutsya pri
#    kazhdoy sborke i tolko zasoryayut istoriyu.
#  * log/ -- zhurnaly progonov. Oni nuzhny tolko dlya razbora K O N K R E T N O J
#    sborki; posle razbora ih smysl propadaet.
#  * *.project i *.~u -- sami fajly proekta i blokirovki. Proekt sozdaetsya
#    zanovo pri kazhdoy sborke, poetomu v git emu ne mesto.
#  * __pycache__ -- kes Python.
#  * *.bak*, *.copy -- rezervnye kopii, kotorye delalis pri otladke.
#    Oni uzhe sygrali svoyu rol, no istoriyu zahlamlyat ne dolzhny.
#
#  Ch T O  K H R A N I M. Vse, chto nelzya vosstanovit: src/ (sgenerirovannye
#  shemy i GVL -- eto vhod dlya sborki), generator/ (sam generator i
#  instrumenty proverki), docs/ (dokumentaciya).
# ============================================================================

# --- rezultaty sborki CODESYS ---
build/
*.project
*.~u
*.simulation.bootinfo
*.simulation.compileinfo
*.precompilecache
*.opt

# --- zhurnaly progonov ---
log/

# --- kes Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# --- rezervnye kopii, ostavshiesya ot otladki ---
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.copy
generator/probe/artifacts/

# --- sluzhebnoe Windows ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
